---
// ACT 1 · HERO — pinned, right-sizing morph field (engine-ascii MorphField).
---
<section id="hero" style="position:relative; height:100vh; overflow:hidden;">
  <canvas id="field" role="img" aria-label="Excess model capacity thinning down to fit the task — the emptiness that opens up is measured savings." style="position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; display:block;"></canvas>
  <div style="position:absolute; inset:0; z-index:2; pointer-events:none; background:radial-gradient(ellipse 62% 58% at 50% 50%, rgba(10,10,11,0.95) 0%, rgba(10,10,11,0.84) 36%, rgba(10,10,11,0) 72%);"></div>
  <div id="herotext" style="position:absolute; inset:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; text-align:center; padding:0 24px; z-index:5; pointer-events:none; text-shadow:0 2px 28px rgba(10,10,11,0.96), 0 0 10px rgba(10,10,11,0.85);">
    <div style="font-size:12px; letter-spacing:0.22em; color:#6cf0a8; margin-bottom:22px; text-transform:uppercase;">in front of claude code &amp; opencode</div>
    <h1 style="margin:0; font-family:'Geist Mono'; font-weight:700; font-size:clamp(36px,6.4vw,84px); line-height:1.0; letter-spacing:-0.035em; color:#fff; text-wrap:balance;">Match the model<br />to the task. <span style="color:#6cf0a8;">Every turn.</span></h1>
    <p style="margin:26px 0 0; font-size:clamp(14px,1.5vw,17px); line-height:1.6; color:#cfcfc8; max-width:600px; text-wrap:pretty;">Tokenomics sits in front of Claude Code and opencode and routes each turn to the model that fits it — across DeepSeek, GLM, Gemini, Qwen, Anthropic and more. Tool calls pass through intact; you see which model ran and why.</p>
    <div style="margin-top:18px; font-size:13px; color:#6cf0a8; letter-spacing:0.02em;">Savings are measured, not promised.</div>
    <div style="margin-top:30px; display:flex; gap:14px; align-items:center; pointer-events:auto; flex-wrap:wrap; justify-content:center;">
      <button id="cta" data-cursor style="font-size:15px; color:#0a0a0b; background:#6cf0a8; border:0; padding:14px 22px; cursor:pointer; letter-spacing:0.01em;"><span id="ctalabel">[ connect your keys ]</span></button>
      <a href="#mech" data-cursor style="font-size:14px; color:#e6e6e1; text-decoration:none; border:1px solid #3a3a3c; padding:14px 18px;">see how it works ↓</a>
    </div>
    <div id="savingscap" style="position:absolute; bottom:42px; left:0; right:0; opacity:0; font-size:13px; color:#6cf0a8;">↑ the emptiness is the spend that never happened — measured, not promised.</div>
  </div>
  <div class="hide-sm" style="position:absolute; bottom:20px; right:28px; z-index:5; font-size:11px; color:#55554f; letter-spacing:0.1em;">scroll to route ↓</div>
</section>
